      },
      {
       "action": "goto_line",
       "target": "c1",
       "line": 3
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "The store needs the add's F4: 2 stalls. It issues in cycle 6."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "mark_lines",
       "target": "c1",
       "from": 4,
       "to": 5
      },
      {
       "action": "goto_line",
       "target": "c1",
       "line": 6
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "The decrement goes in cycle 7. The branch needs its R1: 1 stall, then cycle 9."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "goto_line",
       "target": "c1",
       "line": 7
      },
      {
       "action": "mark_lines",
       "target": "c1",
       "from": 8,
       "to": 8
      },
      {
       "action": "goto_line",
       "target": "c1",
       "line": 9
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "9 cycles per element. Only 3 instructions do the real work: load, add and store. The rest is overhead and stalls."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "mark_lines",
       "target": "c1",
       "from": 1,
       "to": 9
      },
      {
       "action": "write",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "takeaway",
       "text": "as written: 9 cycles per element"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "sched",
   "steps": [
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Stage 3: scheduling. Reorder the instructions to fill the stall slots with useful work."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "head",
       "text": "Stage 3 of 8: scheduling"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "c1"
      },
      {
       "action": "show",
       "target": "c2"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Move the decrement up, into the slot after the load. Now the branch's 1-cycle wait is already over when it arrives."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "goto_line",
       "target": "c2",
       "line": 2
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "But the store now runs after R1 has dropped by 8. So its offset changes from 0 to 8, to reach the same address. The compiler must adjust it."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "goto_line",
       "target": "c2",
       "line": 6
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "The add still has to wait 2 cycles before the store. Nothing is left to fill them."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "mark_lines",
       "target": "c2",
       "from": 4,
       "to": 5
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "7 cycles per element. Only 3 do work; the other 4 are the decrement, the branch, and 2 stalls."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "mark_lines",
       "target": "c2",
       "from": 1,
       "to": 7
      },
      {
       "action": "write",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "takeaway",
       "text": "scheduled: 7 cycles · offsets fixed after moving the decrement"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "unroll",
   "steps": [
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Stage 4: loop unrolling. Copy the loop body 4 times, and keep only one decrement and one branch."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "head",
       "text": "Stage 4 of 8: unrolling four times"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "c2"
      },
      {
       "action": "show",
       "target": "c3"
      },
      {
       "action": "mark_lines",
       "target": "c3",
       "from": 1,
       "to": 12
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Each copy uses its own registers: F0 and F4, F6 and F8, F10 and F12, F14 and F16. That is renaming. Without it, the copies would have name dependences and could never overlap."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "mark_lines",
       "target": "c3",
       "from": 4,
       "to": 6
      },
      {
       "action": "mark_lines",
       "target": "c3",
       "from": 7,
       "to": 9
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "The offsets step by 8: 0, minus 8, minus 16, minus 24. Then one decrement by 32, and one branch."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "mark_lines",
       "target": "c3",
       "from": 13,
       "to": 14
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Without rescheduling, each copy still stalls. A load takes 2 cycles, an add 3, a store 1, and the branch 2. 4 times 6, plus 3: 27 cycles for 4 elements."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "show",
       "target": "c3m"
      },
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "c3m[0]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "6.75 cycles per element. Better than 7, because three decrements and three branches are gone. But the stalls remain."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "write",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "takeaway",
       "text": "unrolled: overhead shared by 4 elements"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
